          "tier": 5,
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "In 1537, Holbein painted his most famous image: Henry VIII standing in a heroic pose with his feet planted apart.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Hans Holbein the Younger",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hans_Holbein_the_Younger",
